{
  "name": "Healthy AI Code",
  "tagline": "29 tools · 28 biomarkers · 46 languages · fully local, no account required",
  "description": "Local MCP server that gives AI assistants objective, score-based code health feedback. Enables a self-correcting refactoring loop where the AI keeps iterating until the health score reaches the target (≥9.5 = AI-ready). Covers TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, Java, C#, Go, Ruby, Rust, PHP, Kotlin, Scala, Swift, Elixir, and 33 more languages. No account, no API key, no external calls.",
